WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.458
Step 1: Open the roster maker with roster-management access. Select the week using the arrows, This week or the calendar. The outlook below the controls shows projected sales, labour budget, roster cost and budget remaining when permitted.

2
00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:23.958
Step 2: Use the Staff, Stacked and Day buttons to choose a view. Press + inside a day/staff cell, then set the shift time, person and position. Today is highlighted in the week grid.

3
00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:31.417
Step 3: Move shifts with their grip; drag a Day-view bar to change staff or time. Check overlap or availability warnings.

4
00:00:31.417 --> 00:00:47.917
Step 4: Review the autosave status and the cost on each shift card. Staff view also shows each person’s weekly total. Click a cost for its calculation or the details needed to price it. Select a shift’s background and use Delete or Backspace to remove it; use Undo if needed.

5
00:00:47.917 --> 00:00:58.167
Step 5: Use Copy week on an empty week to review a copy of the previous week. Check the Draft, Unpublished changes or Published status, then publish separately when ready.
